Relationship to Oxidant
-----------------------

ctxlake is a separate project from the Oxidant query engine
(https://github.com/OxidantData/Oxidant). It does not link Oxidant, and it
requires no query engine to run. The lake it writes is plain partitioned
Parquet, readable by DuckDB, Oxidant, Spark, or anything else that reads
Parquet.

Third-party components
----------------------

This project depends on the Apache Arrow `object_store` crate, Apache Arrow,
Apache Parquet, tokio, and other open-source crates under Apache-2.0 / MIT /
BSD licenses; see Cargo.lock for the full dependency inventory.

The Hermes adapter (adapters/hermes/) is a plugin for the Hermes agent runtime
and uses only the Python standard library. Claude Code, Cursor, and Hermes are
